Package: deepseek-harness
Version: 0.2.1-rc.4
Architecture: all
Pre-Depends: glibc-repo
Maintainer: Alienkrishn [Anon4You]
Depends: glibc-nodejs, bash, coreutils, ca-certificates, ripgrep
Section: ai
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness
Description: DeepSeek Harness (dsh) AI coding agent for Termux
 DeepSeek Harness is an open-source agent harness from DeepSeek AI.
 This package runs the official npm release on the shared glibc Node.js
 runtime from glibc-nodejs and installs the dsh command.
